.agent-orchestration/runs/TASK-005/codex-plan.log:6006:- `Mailbox`: `id`, `org_id`, `google_account_email`, `display_name`, `purpose`, `authorized_by_user_id`, OAuth token ref, `gmail_scope_snapshot`, `connected_at`, `revoked_at`.
